# MOVE-BRIDGE-CLIFF -- R-210 (user report on ALL01: "none of the troops can
# walk on a bridge; even Tanya is able to jump off the cliff and swim").
# [RE: FootClass height gate FUN_004D9B70 (a step keeps its height, or moves
# one level over a slope; a high-bridge deck stands at Level + 4), IsClearToMove
# FUN_004833B0, IsCellOccupied FUN_0051BD70 / FUN_0073DFA0 (an allied Gate=yes
# building opens -> Move::ClosedGate)]. docs/re/movement-height.md.
#  1. Tanya swims to Liberty Island (real clicks), climbs to the island's north
#     edge and is ordered into the river BELOW the cliff: she must not drop the
#     four levels -- she walks down the island's stairs to the shore and swims.
#  2. Fort Bradley: the rendezvous hands the fort (and its border gate) to the
#     player; GIs ordered over the broken east bridge stay on the bank; an
#     engineer repairs the bridge at the hut (real clicks); the GIs then pass
#     their own gate, cross ON the deck and reach the far bank.
# Set-up cheats only spawn the engineer / GIs and walk one GI into the fort's
# rendezvous ring (the mission's own Change House 2a trigger does the rest).
set render_every 0
set campaign ALL01T.MAP GDI
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
until 60 input_locked == 1
until 1500 input_locked == 0
wait 5
# W7 speed model re-tune: Tanya swims her raw 15 leptons/frame now (was 24 with
# GameSpeedBias) and the GIs walk 10 (was 16), so the run is longer and the
# Soviet units kill Tanya (the mission's lose trigger) before it ends. This
# script checks movement over cliffs and bridges, not the fight: the Soviet
# units are removed first.
cheat camp_killu 1 *

# --- 1. Tanya and the cliff --------------------------------------------------------
click unit 0:TANY
wait 1
require selected == 1
click cell 62 77
until 900 units(0,E1) >= 8
assert units(0,TANY) == 1
# up to the island's north edge (level 6) above the river (level 2)
click unit 0:TANY
wait 1
click cell 61 62
waituntil 600 ucell(0,TANY,0) == 61062
require ucell(0,TANY,0) == 61062
assert uheight(0,TANY,0) == 6
view cell 59 60
wait 2
shot tanya_on_edge
# the river at the foot of the cliff (a cell the cliff does not hide)
click unit 0:TANY
wait 1
click cell 57 58
# control for section 3: in the river she does play the Swim set
waituntil 2400 iseq(Swim) >= 1
assert iseq(Swim) >= 1
until 2400 ucell(0,TANY,0) == 57058              @R-210
assert uheight(0,TANY,0) == 2
assert cliff_steps(0) == 0                         @R-210
assert cliff_steps == 0                            @R-210
shot tanya_in_river

# --- 2. Fort Bradley and the east bridge --------------------------------------------
cheat camp_spawn E1 0 62 38
cheat camp_move E1 70 38
until 900 buildings(0,GAGATE_A) >= 1               @R-210
cheat camp_spawn E1 0 83 46 3
cheat camp_spawn ENGINEER 0 82 46
wait 5
# the span is down (the mission's Break Bridges trigger)
assert bridge_destroyed >= 5
view cell 83 47
wait 2
shot fort_gate
# the engineer repairs the bridge at the hut
click unit 0:ENGINEER
wait 1
require selected == 1
click building 4:CABHUT
until 900 bridge_destroyed <= 4                    @R-210
view cell 82 50
wait 2
shot bridge_repaired
# the GIs cross: through their own gate, onto the deck, to the far bank
drag cell 79 45 86 46
wait 1
require sel_n >= 3
assert sel_max_cy <= 47
click cell 82 54
waituntil 600 sel_deck >= 1
assert sel_deck >= 1                               @R-210
assert deck_steps(0) > 0                           @R-210
shot on_deck
waituntil 900 sel_moving == 0
view cell 82 56
wait 2
click cell 82 57
waituntil 900 sel_min_cy >= 56
assert sel_min_cy >= 56                            @R-210
assert sel_deck == 0
assert cliff_steps(0) == 0                         @R-210
shot crossed

# --- 3. Tanya on the bridge deck walks (user report: she played Swim on a bridge) ---
# R-210: a unit on the deck stands on the bridge, not in the water below it.
cheat camp_spawn TANY 0 82 44
wait 2
click unit 0:TANY:1
wait 1
require selected == 1
click cell 82 54
waituntil 600 sel_deck >= 1
assert sel_deck >= 1                               @R-210
assert iseq(Swim) == 0
wait 15
assert sel_deck >= 1
assert iseq(Swim) == 0
shot tanya_on_deck
end
